{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve  summoned a demon girl into your bedroom. Now she needs your help getting back to the afterlife. Get to know Calypso, and choose your words carefully\u2014your decisions directly affect how the rhythm game plays out. Can you survive five days of intense conversations and EDM-fueled challenges?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CALYPSO is a 2D dating sim meets rhythm game, where every choice you make in conversation impacts your performance in the music stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feature List</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Meet Calypso</u> \u2013 A sharp-tongued demon girl with a deep backstory and unexpected charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Choice-Driven Dialogue</u> \u2013 Every response matters. Say the right thing, and you might win her trust\u2014or even her heart.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Rhythm Game with Consequences</u> \u2013 Your dialogue choices affect how tough the music levels are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>5 Days of Content</u> \u2013 Each in-game day brings new dialogue, a unique EDM track, and a piece of Calypso\u2019s backstory to uncover.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693340?t=1749017608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3693340?t=1749017608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693340/837eb3d0787609689dcee4c98e077441e84c2b0a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749017608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693340/837eb3d0787609689dcee4c98e077441e84c2b0a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749017608","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}